            <remarks>
              Compression is a reduction in the fluctuation of a signal above a certain amplitude.
            </remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="M:VisioForge.Core.VideoEdit.VideoEditCore.Audio_Effects_DS_Distortion(System.Int32,System.String,System.Single,System.Single,System.Single,System.Single,System.Single)">
            <summary>
              Sets the parameters for the DS Distortion effect.
            </summary>
            <param name = "streamIndex">
              Stream index.
            </param>
            <param name = "name">
              The name.
            </param>
            <param name = "edge">
              Specifies the edge of the filter (0.0 - 100.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "gain">
              Specifies the gain of the filter (-60.0 - 0).
            </param>
            <param name = "postEQBandwidth">
              Specifies the bandwidth of the equalizer (100.0 - 8000.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "postEQCenterFrequency">
              Specifies the center frequency of the distortion equalizer (100.0 - 8000.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "preLowpassCutOff">
              Specifies the low pass cutoff of the filter (100.0 - 8000.0).
            </param>
            <remarks>
              Distortion is achieved by adding harmonics to the signal in such a way that, as the level increases, 
              the top of the waveform becomes squared off or clipped.
            </remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="M:VisioForge.Core.VideoEdit.VideoEditCore.Audio_Effects_DS_Echo(System.Int32,System.String,System.Single,System.Single,System.Single,System.Int32,System.Single)">
            <summary>
              Sets the parameters for the DS Echo effect.
            </summary>
            <param name = "streamIndex">
              Stream index.
            </param>
            <param name = "name">
              The name.
            </param>
            <param name = "feedback">
              Specifies the feedback of the filter (0 - 100.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "leftDelay">
              Specifies the left delay of the filter (1.0 - 2000.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "rightDelay">
              Specifies the right delay of the filter (1.0 - 2000.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "panDelay">
              The pan delay.
            </param>
            <param name = "wetDryMix">
              Specifies the wet and dry mix of the filter (0.0 - 100.0).
            </param>
            <remarks>
              An echo effect causes sounds to be repeated after a fixed delay, usually at a diminished volume.
              As the repeated sounds are fed back into the mix, they are repeated again.
            </remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="M:VisioForge.Core.VideoEdit.VideoEditCore.Audio_Effects_DS_Flanger(System.Int32,System.String,System.Single,System.Single,System.Single,System.Single,System.Int32,VisioForge.Core.Types.AudioEffects.DSFlangerWaveForm,System.Single)">
            <summary>
              Sets the parameters for the DS Flanger effect.
            </summary>
            <param name = "streamIndex">
              Stream index.
            </param>
            <param name = "name">
              The name.
            </param>
            <param name = "delay">
              Specifies the delay of the filter (0.0 - 4.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "depth">
              Specifies the depth of the filter (0.0 - 100.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "feedback">
              Specifies the feedback of the filter (-99.0 - 99.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "frequency">
              Specifies the frequency of the filter (0.0 - 10.0).
            </param>
            <param name = "phase">
              Specifies the phase angle. 
            </param>
            <param name = "waveform">
              Specifies the waveform type of the filter.
            </param>
            <param name = "wetDryMix">
              Specifies the wet and dry mix of the filter (0.0 - 100.0).
            </param>
            <remarks>
              Flange, also called flanger, is an echo effect in which the delay between the original signal and 
              its echo is very short and varies over time. The result is sometimes referred to as a sweeping sound.
              The term flange originated with the practice of grabbing the flanges of a tape reel to change the speed.
            </remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="M:VisioForge.Core.VideoEdit.VideoEditCore.Audio_Effects_DS_Gargle(System.Int32,System.String,System.Int32,VisioForge.Core.Types.AudioEffects.DSGargleWaveForm)">
            <summary>
